@startuml
title GET /api/service/ready — HTTP liveness probe
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Operator /\norchestrator" as Op #FFD8C2
participant "Client\n(generated ServiceApi)" as Client #D5EAF7
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8

Op -> Client : readiness check
Client -> API : GET /api/service/ready
API --> Client : 200, no body
Client --> Op : HTTP tier is serving

note over API #FFF0C7
The handler returns Ok(()) unconditionally
(api/service/endpoints.rs:11-14). A 200 attests
only that the HTTP tier is serving requests; it
performs no chain, node, or dependency check.
end note
@enduml
